#: ../../source/writing-plans_SKILL.md:208
msgid ""
"**Bad:** Copy-paste validation in 3 places **Good:** Extract validation "
"function, use everywhere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/writing-plans_SKILL.md:211
msgid "YAGNI (You Aren't Gonna Need It)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/writing-plans_SKILL.md:213
msgid ""
"**Bad:** Add \"flexibility\" for future requirements **Good:** Implement "
"only what's needed now"
